      "description": "Current workflow should:\n\n1. Check the status of the API\n    \n2. Check status of DB\n    \n3. Authorize with environment variables (currently settled as admin)\n    \n4. After authorizing, receive token and save it as collection variable\n    \n5. By using received token, post new snapshot to a DB, save posted snapshot id\n    \n6. Return last snapshot\n    \n7. Return spreads of snapshot, by using posted snapshot id as reference"
